      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ],
      "description": "App version last acknowledged by finishing or skipping onboarding / What's New. null = never stamped (fresh install, or a v4 upgrade that only has onboardingCompleted). Do not default this to the current app version — absence is how we detect \"updated from before 5.0.0\"."
