    "StoredAccount": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "badge": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "nickname": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "displayName": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "token": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "addedAt": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "lastUsedAt": {
          "type": "number"
        }
      }
    },
    "CurrentTermSearchSource": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "yanhekt",
        "local",
        "online"
      ],
      "description": "Where course searches and course lookups get their answers (Settings → General → Search). Shared by main, the renderer and the CLI.\n\nCurrent term: one source, no fallback. Yanhekt answers loosely related courses for most keywords, so \"no match\" cannot be told from a poor answer.   yanhekt  Yanhekt's own course search (default)   local    the course index on this computer (needs the downloaded current term)   online   the AutoSlides Index (share.ruc.edu.kg)\n\nEarlier terms, a course's session ids when Yanhekt's lists are empty, and course lookups by id or registrar code:   local-then-online  the course index on this computer, then the AutoSlides                      Index (default). A keyword search uses the local copy                      when it holds the term, else the online Index; an exact                      lookup (session ids, an id, a code) asks online when the                      local copy has no answer, since it may be stale.   online             the AutoSlides Index only"
    },
    "EarlierTermSearchSource": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "local-then-online",
        "online"
      ]
    }
  }
}
